The MIT licence above covers the DiaLense source code, scenarios, and analysis
outputs authored in this repository.

data/mts_dialog/ contains material derived from the MTS-Dialog corpus
(Ben Abacha, Yim, Fan & Lin, EACL 2023), distributed by its authors under a
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence. That material remains
under CC BY 4.0; the full licence text is included at
data/mts_dialog/LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Clinical scenarios in src/dialense/generation/scenarios.py are restructured
derivations from that corpus and likewise carry the CC BY 4.0 attribution
requirement. Per-scenario provenance is recorded in scenarios/provenance.csv.
